{
  "schemaVersion": "0.1.0",
  "contentVersion": "1.0.0",
  "volume": "V01",
  "title": "黑雨",
  "subtitle": "赤水有尸，天上少了一轮太阳",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "V01-C01-N001",
      "chapter": "ACT1_RAIN_ARRIVES",
      "title": "雨在落下以前",
      "presentation": "prologue",
      "blocks": [
        {"type": "narration", "text": "后来杳湾的人把那一年叫作黑雨元年，仿佛世界从前没有年岁，只有庄稼熟过多少回、赤水淹死过多少人。事实上，雨落下以前，村里刚丢了一只白羊，砚伯还在晒他那本被虫吃空了半边的历书，渡口的宿沙为一枚贝币同商旅争吵。每个人都忙着一件足以占满一生的小事，因此谁也没有抬头。"},
        {"type": "narration", "text": "你正在{{player.originScene}}。第一滴雨落在手背上，凉得像井底捞出的铜。它没有立刻散开，而是伏在皮肤上，映出一个比正午更亮的天空；那天空中没有太阳，只有十个尚未睁开的红点。你眨眼时，水珠已经黑了。"},
        {"type": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC-AHE", "text": "别擦。鸡沾了这个，刚才把自己的影子啄死了。"},
        {"type": "narration", "text": "说话的是牧羊女阿禾。她抱着那只失踪的白羊，羊还活着，四蹄却各踩着一小片夜。远处有人敲起避雨的木梆，第一声从村东传来，第二声却从赤水底下回答。"}
      ],
      "onEnterEffects": [
        {"type": "setWorldVar", "key": "weather.black_rain.day", "value": 1},
        {"type": "startQuest", "questId": "Q-V01-MAIN-001"},
        {"type": "unlockCodex", "codexId": "CX-V01-EVENT-BLACKRAIN", "layer": "first_sight"}
      ],
      "choices": [
        {"id": "V01-C01-N001-A", "label": "护送阿禾和白羊回村", "effects": [{"type": "changeRelation", "npcId": "NPC-AHE", "axis": "trust", "delta": 2}], "next": "V01-C01-N002"},
        {"id": "V01-C01-N001-B", "label": "赶往正在进水的粮仓", "effects": [{"type": "setWorldVar", "key": "village.granary.saved", "value": true}], "next": "V01-C01-N003"},
        {"id": "V01-C01-N001-C", "label": "跑向赤水渡口", "effects": [{"type": "changeRelation", "npcId": "NPC-SUSHA", "axis": "trust", "delta": 1}], "next": "V01-C01-N004"},
        {"id": "V01-C01-N001-D", "label": "【灵识】观察雨滴里的十个红点", "sourceTag": "灵识", "visibleWhen": [{"type": "playerStatAtLeast", "stat": "spirit", "value": 4}], "effects": [{"type": "addKnowledge", "subjectId": "CX-V01-EVENT-BLACKRAIN", "amount": 1}, {"type": "addStatus", "statusId": "ST-RainMarked", "duration": "ACT1"}], "next": "V01-C01-N005"}
      ],
      "tags": ["main", "black_rain", "origin_hook"]
    },
    {
      "id": "V01-C01-N002",
      "chapter": "ACT1_RAIN_ARRIVES",
      "title": "羊有四片夜",
      "presentation": "scene",
      "blocks": [
        {"type": "narration", "text": "回村的路不过三百步，黑雨却把它下得比冬天还长。阿禾不肯把羊放下。羊腹沉重，像吞了一块石头，每走几步便回头望东边。它的四道影子并不随身体移动，留在泥里慢慢挣扎。"},
        {"type": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC-AHE", "text": "它叫小满。我娘说，叫了名字的东西就不能随便死。"},
        {"type": "narration", "text": "你们经过桑树时，小满突然咬住一片叶。叶背粘着细小的金灰，雨浇不灭，反而发出晒热被褥的气味。你用布裹住它，掌心立刻浮出一圈温暖的光，像有人在很远的地方记住了你。"},
        {"type": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC-AHE", "text": "东边的桑林昨晚也亮过。不是火。火不会一边烧，一边长叶子。"}
      ],
      "onExitEffects": [
        {"type": "addItem", "itemId": "IT-V01-MAT-EMBERLEAF", "quantity": 1},
        {"type": "unlockCodex", "codexId": "CX-V01-MAT-EMBERLEAF", "layer": "first_sight"},
        {"type": "setFlag", "key": "clue.east_mulberry_glow", "value": true}
      ],
      "choices": [
        {"id": "V01-C01-N002-A", "label": "替小满洗去蹄上的黑泥", "costs": [{"type": "time", "minutes": 10}], "effects": [{"type": "setWorldVar", "key": "npc.goat_xiaoman.alive", "value": true}, {"type": "changeRelation", "npcId": "NPC-AHE", "axis": "debt", "delta": 1}], "next": "V01-C01-N006"},
        {"id": "V01-C01-N002-B", "label": "保留黑泥作证", "effects": [{"type": "addItem", "itemId": "IT-V01-MAT-SHADOWMUD", "quantity": 1}], "next": "V01-C01-N006"}
      ],
      "tags": ["main", "first_material", "ahe"]
    },
    {
      "id": "V01-C01-N003",
      "chapter": "ACT1_RAIN_ARRIVES",
      "title": "湿粮",
      "presentation": "scene",
      "blocks": [
        {"type": "narration", "text": "粮仓的茅顶没有漏，水却从谷粒内部往外渗。青芽和两个老人把麻袋拖到高处，袋缝里流出的不是水，是黑得发亮的细线。你割开最重的一袋，看见粟米都长出了透明的根，根须一致指向东方。"},
        {"type": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC-QINGYA", "text": "别丢。毒死人的粮也是粮。先记住它怎么毒，再决定给谁吃。"},
        {"type": "narration", "text": "你们用陶片和干沙隔开湿粮。黑线碰到陶土便蜷缩，发出婴儿梦呓般的轻响。直到最后一袋搬完，你才发现自己的影子留在仓门外，没有跟进来。青芽拿灯照了照你脚下，什么也没说，只把一枚烧裂的陶哨塞进你手里。"}
      ],
      "onExitEffects": [
        {"type": "addItem", "itemId": "IT-V01-TOOL-CRACKEDWHISTLE", "quantity": 1},
        {"type": "setWorldVar", "key": "village.food_supply", "value": 3},
        {"type": "changeRelation", "npcId": "NPC-QINGYA", "axis": "respect", "delta": 1},
        {"type": "setFlag", "key": "clue.roots_point_east", "value": true}
      ],
      "choices": [
        {"id": "V01-C01-N003-A", "label": "去祠屋参加议事", "next": "V01-C01-N006"}
      ],
      "tags": ["main", "granary", "world_echo_seed"]
    },
    {
      "id": "V01-C01-N004",
      "chapter": "ACT1_RAIN_ARRIVES",
      "title": "倒着到来的船",
      "presentation": "scene",
      "blocks": [
        {"type": "narration", "text": "赤水仍向东流，浪花却一朵接一朵退回上游。宿沙站在齐腰深的水里，用缆绳套住一条倒退而来的空船。船头朝东，船却从东边来，舱中铺满温热的红沙。"},
        {"type": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC-SUSHA", "text": "三十年了，河带走的东西从不肯还。今日它大方，怕是要收利。"},
        {"type": "narration", "text": "你拉住缆绳时，船底传来三下叩击。宿沙的手立刻松了半寸。那是渡工求岸的旧信号，而这条船半年前沉在下游，连同他的长子一起。"},
        {"type": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC-SUSHA", "text": "若里面真是他，我便开舱。若不是他，我更该开。你替我记着：是我开的。"}
      ],
      "choices": [
        {"id": "V01-C01-N004-A", "label": "拉船上岸，暂不启舱", "effects": [{"type": "setFlag", "key": "clue.returned_boat", "value": true}, {"type": "changeRelation", "npcId": "NPC-SUSHA", "axis": "trust", "delta": 1}], "next": "V01-C01-N006"},
        {"id": "V01-C01-N004-B", "label": "割断缆绳，让船退回东边", "effects": [{"type": "setWorldVar", "key": "river.returned_boat_released", "value": true}, {"type": "changeRelation", "npcId": "NPC-SUSHA", "axis": "trust", "delta": -1}], "next": "V01-C01-N006"}
      ],
      "tags": ["main", "river", "susha"]
    },
    {
      "id": "V01-C01-N005",
      "chapter": "ACT1_RAIN_ARRIVES",
      "title": "被雨看见",
      "presentation": "vision",
      "blocks": [
        {"type": "narration", "text": "你没有擦去雨。十个红点在水珠里逐一睁开，其中九个照着你，最后一个照着你身后的空地。那空地先长出一棵通天的桑，再悬起一具胸口有箭的人。人的三道影子分别跪着、奔跑、张弓，动作互不相认。"},
        {"type": "narration", "text": "幻象只存在一息。醒来时阿禾正用袖口替你擦手。她的袖子被雨烧出十个小洞。你的皮肤没有伤，却多了一圈淡金色细纹，像一只没有瞳孔的眼。"},
        {"type": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC-AHE", "text": "现在它认识你了。别怕，认识不等于喜欢。村里人都认识我，也没几个喜欢我。"}
      ],
      "onExitEffects": [
        {"type": "setFlag", "key": "clue.ten_red_points", "value": true},
        {"type": "addKnowledge", "subjectId": "CX-V01-EVENT-BLACKRAIN", "amount": 1}
      ],
      "choices": [
        {"id": "V01-C01-N005-A", "label": "带阿禾回村", "effects": [{"type": "changeRelation", "npcId": "NPC-AHE", "axis": "trust", "delta": 1}], "next": "V01-C01-N006"}
      ],
      "tags": ["main", "vision", "foreshadowing"]
    },
    {
      "id": "V01-C01-N006",
      "chapter": "ACT1_RAIN_ARRIVES",
      "title": "第一夜的议事",
      "presentation": "dialogue",
      "blocks": [
        {"type": "narration", "text": "祠屋里挤着四十七个人，祖灵牌被挪去堵漏。砚伯坚持说这是祖宗第一次替活人挡雨，因此不算不敬。缄婆坐在火塘边，往火里撒盐；盐没有炸响，像雪一样融进炭中。"},
        {"type": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC-YANBO", "text": "历上说今日晴。历若没错，就是天错了。"},
        {"type": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC-JIANPO", "text": "天不会错。写天的人会。"},
        {"type": "narration", "text": "村人争论该封井、宰牲、逃往南坡还是继续等雨停。你讲述自己所见。有人相信，有人不信，还有人只计算每一种说法会让自家少分多少粮。正在这时，屋外的木梆响了第三遍。守夜人隗青推门进来，雨水沿他的蓑衣滴落，在地上形成一个人形。"},
        {"type": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC-WEIQING", "text": "北滩有东西。像人。胸口插着箭。它有三道影子。"}
      ],
      "onEnterEffects": [{"type": "completeObjective", "questId": "Q-V01-MAIN-001", "objectiveId": "reach_council"}],
      "choices": [
        {"id": "V01-C01-N006-A", "label": "立即前往北滩", "effects": [{"type": "setFlag", "key": "village.council_choice", "value": "investigate_now"}], "next": "V01-C01-N007"},
        {"id": "V01-C01-N006-B", "label": "先组织封井与接雨禁令", "costs": [{"type": "time", "minutes": 20}], "effects": [{"type": "setWorldVar", "key": "village.water_sickness", "value": 0}, {"type": "changeRelation", "npcId": "NPC-YANBO", "axis": "respect", "delta": 1}], "next": "V01-C01-N007"},
        {"id": "V01-C01-N006-C", "label": "先让每户报人数与牲畜", "costs": [{"type": "time", "minutes": 15}], "effects": [{"type": "setFlag", "key": "clue.missing_people_counted", "value": true}, {"type": "changeRelation", "npcId": "NPC-JIANPO", "axis": "respect", "delta": 1}], "next": "V01-C01-N007"}
      ],
      "tags": ["main", "council", "first_relation"]
    },
    {
      "id": "V01-C01-N007",
      "chapter": "ACT2_THREE_SHADOWS",
      "title": "北滩有尸",
      "presentation": "reveal",
      "blocks": [
        {"type": "narration", "text": "北滩原是一片白石。黑雨把石头染得像未干的墨，只有滩心那个人仍是白的。他仰面躺在浅水中，长发没有漂动，衣袍既不像麻也不像丝，仿佛由正午最亮的那一刻织成。胸口贯着一支赤金箭，箭尾没有羽。"},
        {"type": "narration", "text": "火把在他身边照出三道影子。一道属于少年，蜷着膝；一道属于长翼的鸟，喙抵东方；最后一道没有头，双手仍在结一个未完的印。尸体本身却没有影子。"},
        {"type": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC-WEIQING", "text": "我没碰。不是因为敬神，是因为箭在往外长。"},
        {"type": "narration", "text": "你俯身看去。箭杆上每隔一息便生出一圈细小的金纹，如树记年轮。最新的一圈，恰在你靠近时合拢。尸体的左手攥着焦黑桑叶，右手腕系着一块写有陌生日名的骨牌。黑雨落到他的眼皮上，全部滑向东方。"}
      ],
      "onEnterEffects": [
        {"type": "unlockCodex", "codexId": "CX-V01-PERSON-THREESHADOW", "layer": "first_sight"},
        {"type": "startQuest", "questId": "Q-V01-MAIN-002"},
        {"type": "setWorldVar", "key": "corpse.integrity", "value": 100}
      ],
      "choices": [
        {"id": "V01-C01-N007-A", "label": "检查赤金箭", "visibleWhen": [{"type": "flagFalse", "key": "clue.arrow_name_yi"}], "next": "V01-C01-N008"},
        {"id": "V01-C01-N007-B", "label": "检查三道影子", "visibleWhen": [{"type": "flagFalse", "key": "clue.shadow_memory_ten"}], "next": "V01-C01-N009"},
        {"id": "V01-C01-N007-C", "label": "检查骨牌与桑叶", "visibleWhen": [{"type": "flagFalse", "key": "clue.bone_token_fusang"}], "next": "V01-C01-N010"},
        {"id": "V01-C01-N007-D", "label": "先封锁北滩，不触碰尸体", "visibleWhen": [{"type": "allFlagsFalse", "keys": ["clue.arrow_name_yi", "clue.shadow_memory_ten", "clue.bone_token_fusang"]}], "effects": [{"type": "setWorldVar", "key": "corpse.contamination", "value": 0}], "next": "V01-C01-N011"},
        {"id": "V01-C01-N007-E", "label": "结束调查，等待天象变化", "visibleWhen": [{"type": "anyFlagTrue", "keys": ["clue.arrow_name_yi", "clue.shadow_memory_ten", "clue.bone_token_fusang"]}], "next": "V01-C01-N012"}
      ],
      "tags": ["main", "corpse", "investigation_hub"]
    },
    {
      "id": "V01-C01-N008",
      "chapter": "ACT2_THREE_SHADOWS",
      "title": "尚未射出的箭",
      "presentation": "investigation",
      "blocks": [
        {"type": "narration", "text": "你没有拔箭，只用陶哨的裂口贴近箭杆。金属内部传来弓弦震动，先是一声，随后又有九声从极远处依次应和。第十声响完，尸体胸腔里有东西轻轻翻身。"},
        {"type": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC-WEIQING", "text": "箭伤四周没有血。不是死后插的，是这具身体从箭上长出来的。"},
        {"type": "narration", "text": "箭镞朝西，伤口里的灼痕却向东延伸。这意味着箭由西方射来，死者却在中箭以后继续朝东方燃烧。箭杆近镞处刻着一个极浅的‘羿’字，笔画末端崭新，仿佛刻字的人还没来得及把刀抬起。"}
      ],
      "onExitEffects": [
        {"type": "setFlag", "key": "clue.arrow_name_yi", "value": true},
        {"type": "addKnowledge", "subjectId": "CX-V01-ITEM-REDARROW", "amount": 1},
        {"type": "completeObjective", "questId": "Q-V01-MAIN-002", "objectiveId": "inspect_one_clue"}
      ],
      "choices": [
        {"id": "V01-C01-N008-A", "label": "继续检查其他线索", "next": "V01-C01-N007"},
        {"id": "V01-C01-N008-B", "label": "尝试拓下箭杆铭文", "costs": [{"type": "itemDurability", "itemId": "IT-V01-TOOL-CRACKEDWHISTLE", "amount": 1}], "effects": [{"type": "addItem", "itemId": "IT-V01-CLUE-ARROWRUBBING", "quantity": 1}, {"type": "changeWorldVar", "key": "corpse.integrity", "delta": -5}], "next": "V01-C01-N007"}
      ],
      "tags": ["main", "clue", "arrow"]
    },
    {
      "id": "V01-C01-N009",
      "chapter": "ACT2_THREE_SHADOWS",
      "title": "影子各有旧事",
      "presentation": "investigation",
      "blocks": [
        {"type": "narration", "text": "你绕尸体走了一圈，三道影子始终停在原处。少年影子的手指沾着河泥，鸟影的羽尖嵌有盐粒，无头影子的袖中则落下一点金灰。影子不是光造成的，它们更像三段被迫留在地上的证词。"},
        {"type": "narration", "text": "当你把自己的手叠在少年影上，一段不属于你的记忆涌来：有人在高桑之巅数兄弟，数到第九便不敢再数；远处一个女人驾着六龙之车，反复告诫他们轮流照临人间。记忆中的第十个位置一直空着。"},
        {"type": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC-JIANPO", "text": "影子不会撒谎，因为它连自己是谁都不知道。人会替它撒。"}
      ],
      "onExitEffects": [
        {"type": "setFlag", "key": "clue.shadow_memory_ten", "value": true},
        {"type": "unlockCodex", "codexId": "CX-V01-PERSON-THREESHADOW", "layer": "rumor"},
        {"type": "completeObjective", "questId": "Q-V01-MAIN-002", "objectiveId": "inspect_one_clue"}
      ],
      "choices": [
        {"id": "V01-C01-N009-A", "label": "松开影子，继续调查", "next": "V01-C01-N007"},
        {"id": "V01-C01-N009-B", "label": "【心志】追问空缺的第十个位置", "sourceTag": "心志", "enabledWhen": [{"type": "playerStatAtLeast", "stat": "will", "value": 4}], "disabledHint": "你能感觉到记忆在排斥追问。", "costs": [{"type": "resource", "resource": "stress", "amount": 2}], "effects": [{"type": "setFlag", "key": "clue.shadow_says_not_dead", "value": true}], "next": "V01-C01-N007"}
      ],
      "tags": ["main", "clue", "shadow_memory"]
    },
    {
      "id": "V01-C01-N010",
      "chapter": "ACT2_THREE_SHADOWS",
      "title": "没有写完的日名",
      "presentation": "investigation",
      "blocks": [
        {"type": "narration", "text": "骨牌一面画桑，一面写日名。那字你不认得，却知道应该怎样读，像婴儿天生会寻找乳汁。读音抵达舌尖时，黑雨突然加重，周围所有人同时忘记自己方才说过的话。"},
        {"type": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC-YANBO", "text": "别念。名字是门，念出声就是替里面的人开。"},
        {"type": "narration", "text": "焦叶与阿禾在路上拾到的金灰气味相同。两片残叶拼在一起，叶脉组成一幅极简的水路：赤水向东，越盐泽，过无潮海，止于一棵托日的桑。地图末端被人用指甲划去，留下十道平行伤痕。"}
      ],
      "onExitEffects": [
        {"type": "setFlag", "key": "clue.bone_token_fusang", "value": true},
        {"type": "addItem", "itemId": "IT-V01-CLUE-DAYTOKEN", "quantity": 1},
        {"type": "completeObjective", "questId": "Q-V01-MAIN-002", "objectiveId": "inspect_one_clue"}
      ],
      "choices": [
        {"id": "V01-C01-N010-A", "label": "收起骨牌，继续调查", "next": "V01-C01-N007"},
        {"id": "V01-C01-N010-B", "label": "【无名之人】念出那个名字", "sourceTag": "无名之人", "visibleWhen": [{"type": "playerOriginIs", "origin": "nameless"}], "irreversible": true, "effects": [{"type": "addStatus", "statusId": "ST-NameBorrowed", "duration": "VOLUME"}, {"type": "setFlag", "key": "clue.true_day_name_heard", "value": true}], "next": "V01-C01-N007"}
      ],
      "tags": ["main", "clue", "fusang"]
    },
    {
      "id": "V01-C01-N011",
      "chapter": "ACT2_THREE_SHADOWS",
      "title": "把未知留在原地",
      "presentation": "scene",
      "blocks": [
        {"type": "narration", "text": "你让隗青插下火把，沿北滩撒一圈白灰。没有人靠近，尸体的秘密便暂时完整；代价是秘密也得以自由生长。天亮前，杳湾已有七种说法：死者是落水的神、九黎的细作、被雷劈白的商人、羿失手射下的星、赤水长出的儿子、村人共同做的梦，以及一个专门来替大家承担灾祸的陌生人。"},
        {"type": "narration", "text": "第七种说法最受欢迎。人们已经开始往封锁线外放粟米和旧衣。缄婆看着那些供物，叹气说，众人一旦希望尸体替他们受苦，便会恨任何试图查明尸体身份的人。"}
      ],
      "onExitEffects": [
        {"type": "setWorldVar", "key": "village.corpse_cult", "value": 1},
        {"type": "startQuest", "questId": "Q-V01-SIDE-003"}
      ],
      "choices": [
        {"id": "V01-C01-N011-A", "label": "听取村人的七种说法", "next": "V01-C01-N012"}
      ],
      "tags": ["main", "rumor", "world_state"]
    },
    {
      "id": "V01-C01-N012",
      "chapter": "ACT2_THREE_SHADOWS",
      "title": "第二个月亮",
      "presentation": "act_break",
      "blocks": [
        {"type": "narration", "text": "黑雨第三日，太阳没有升起。正午的天色如旧铁，村民在无影的地上走来走去，人人显得比平时孤单。到黄昏，东边升起第二个月亮。它比原来的月亮更白、更近，表面没有桂影，只有一支缓慢旋转的箭。"},
        {"type": "narration", "text": "三影尸体在双月下坐了起来。不是复活，只是三道影子一齐站直，把尸身从水中托起。它张开嘴，吐出一条活着的黑线。黑线钻入河中，赤水随即停流。"},
        {"type": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC-JIANPO", "text": "现在可以怕了。河一旦想起自己从哪里来，就会倒着回去。"},
        {"type": "system", "text": "主线更新：在赤水倒流前查明黑雨如何进入村落。你无法在一次流程中保存所有证据与所有人。"}
      ],
      "onEnterEffects": [
        {"type": "setWorldVar", "key": "sky.moons.count", "value": 2},
        {"type": "setWorldVar", "key": "river.flow", "value": "stalled"},
        {"type": "advanceTime", "days": 2},
        {"type": "startQuest", "questId": "Q-V01-MAIN-003"}
      ],
      "choices": [
        {"id": "V01-C01-N012-A", "label": "去河床追那条黑线", "next": "V01-C01-N013"},
        {"id": "V01-C01-N012-B", "label": "去东桑林求证焦叶", "next": "V01-C01-N014"},
        {"id": "V01-C01-N012-C", "label": "留在村中追查供尸之人", "visibleWhen": [{"type": "worldVarAtLeast", "key": "village.corpse_cult", "value": 1}], "next": "V01-C01-N015"}
      ],
      "tags": ["main", "moon", "act_break"]
    },
    {
      "id": "V01-C01-N013",
      "chapter": "ACT3_RIVER_REVERSED",
      "title": "河床下的路",
      "presentation": "exploration",
      "blocks": [
        {"type": "narration", "text": "赤水停流后，河床像一条被剖开的兽腹。鱼悬在半空摆尾，水退到两侧，露出历年淹没的东西：陶罐、牛角、半扇门、三十七枚不同朝向的牙齿。宿沙在最深处找到儿子的船，舱门仍从里面叩响。"},
        {"type": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC-SUSHA", "text": "活人敲门是求开，死人敲门是劝你别开。我儿从小懂事，死了也该懂。"},
        {"type": "narration", "text": "黑线从船底穿过，通往上游旧盐井。线旁生着一簇透明芦苇，每一节都囚着一滴黑雨。你割下一节，雨在芦腔里发出许多人的低语：‘不是从天上来的，是天上不要了。’"}
      ],
      "onExitEffects": [
        {"type": "addItem", "itemId": "IT-V01-MAT-RAINREED", "quantity": 1},
        {"type": "setFlag", "key": "clue.black_line_saltwell", "value": true},
        {"type": "unlockCodex", "codexId": "CX-V01-MAT-RAINREED", "layer": "first_sight"}
      ],
      "choices": [
        {"id": "V01-C01-N013-A", "label": "打开沉船舱门", "effects": [{"type": "setFlag", "key": "susha.son_truth_opened", "value": true}, {"type": "changeRelation", "npcId": "NPC-SUSHA", "axis": "trust", "delta": 2}], "next": "V01-C01-N016"},
        {"id": "V01-C01-N013-B", "label": "尊重宿沙的迟疑，封住舱门", "effects": [{"type": "setFlag", "key": "susha.son_boat_sealed", "value": true}, {"type": "changeRelation", "npcId": "NPC-SUSHA", "axis": "respect", "delta": 1}], "next": "V01-C01-N016"},
        {"id": "V01-C01-N013-C", "label": "沿黑线直奔旧盐井", "next": "V01-C01-N016"}
      ],
      "tags": ["main", "exploration", "river"]
    },
    {
      "id": "V01-C01-N014",
      "chapter": "ACT3_RIVER_REVERSED",
      "title": "一夜长成的桑林",
      "presentation": "exploration",
      "blocks": [
        {"type": "narration", "text": "东桑林原本只有二十七棵树，阿禾说她逐一给树取过名字。如今林中挤着二百七十棵，每十棵共用一团根，枝头的叶子一面焦黑、一面新绿。林子中央悬着十只空鸟巢，九只尚温，最小的一只落满黑雨。"},
        {"type": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC-AHE", "text": "多出来的树没有名字。没名字的东西会不会比较容易被砍？"},
        {"type": "narration", "text": "你将先前拾到的焦叶贴上树皮。金灰沿叶脉亮起，正式的名字从认知深处浮现：扶桑烬。它不是树烧剩的灰，而是某段白昼被抹去后留下的余温。用清水浸泡，它能让被黑雨洗去的一句话重新显现；每显现一次，持有者会忘记一件与那句话无关的小事。"},
        {"type": "system", "text": "材料显形：IT-V01-MAT-EMBERLEAF 已由【初见】提升至【实证】。解锁行动：照见被洗去的言语。"}
      ],
      "onExitEffects": [
        {"type": "revealItem", "itemId": "IT-V01-MAT-EMBERLEAF", "stage": "verified"},
        {"type": "unlockCodex", "codexId": "CX-V01-MAT-EMBERLEAF", "layer": "evidence"},
        {"type": "setFlag", "key": "clue.fusang_ash_verified", "value": true},
        {"type": "completeObjective", "questId": "Q-V01-MAIN-003", "objectiveId": "verify_material"}
      ],
      "choices": [
        {"id": "V01-C01-N014-A", "label": "带走落满黑雨的空巢", "effects": [{"type": "addItem", "itemId": "IT-V01-TOOL-DARKNEST", "quantity": 1}, {"type": "changeWorldVar", "key": "grove.stability", "delta": -1}], "next": "V01-C01-N016"},
        {"id": "V01-C01-N014-B", "label": "替多出的桑树逐一系上名字", "costs": [{"type": "time", "minutes": 60}], "effects": [{"type": "setWorldVar", "key": "grove.named_trees", "value": true}, {"type": "changeRelation", "npcId": "NPC-AHE", "axis": "respect", "delta": 2}], "next": "V01-C01-N016"},
        {"id": "V01-C01-N014-C", "label": "采集更多扶桑烬", "effects": [{"type": "addItem", "itemId": "IT-V01-MAT-EMBERLEAF", "quantity": 2}, {"type": "addStatus", "statusId": "ST-MemoryFray", "duration": "VOLUME"}], "next": "V01-C01-N016"}
      ],
      "tags": ["main", "material_reveal", "fusang"]
    },
    {
      "id": "V01-C01-N015",
      "chapter": "ACT3_RIVER_REVERSED",
      "title": "替尸体做梦的人",
      "presentation": "investigation",
      "blocks": [
        {"type": "narration", "text": "供物每天都多，守夜人却从未看见谁来。你伏在祠屋后的枣树下，直到双月走到同一片云里，才看见十二岁的砚童抱着一碗粟粥穿过雨。他闭着眼，脚步却准确避开每一块石。"},
        {"type": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC-YANTONG", "text": "不是我要喂他。梦里的哥哥说，他饿了就会想起自己是谁；想起来，天上便少一个。"},
        {"type": "narration", "text": "砚童的后颈粘着一枚黑色羽片。羽片没有重量，却把他的影子钉向东方。你叫醒他时，碗中粟粥已变成细小的、尚未孵化的黑卵。"}
      ],
      "onExitEffects": [
        {"type": "addItem", "itemId": "IT-V01-MAT-NIGHTFEATHER", "quantity": 1},
        {"type": "setFlag", "key": "clue.dream_feeding", "value": true},
        {"type": "setWorldVar", "key": "village.corpse_cult", "value": 0}
      ],
      "choices": [
        {"id": "V01-C01-N015-A", "label": "把真相告诉砚伯", "effects": [{"type": "changeRelation", "npcId": "NPC-YANBO", "axis": "trust", "delta": 2}, {"type": "setWorldVar", "key": "yantong.publicly_blamed", "value": false}], "next": "V01-C01-N016"},
        {"id": "V01-C01-N015-B", "label": "隐去砚童姓名，只焚毁黑卵", "effects": [{"type": "changeRelation", "npcId": "NPC-YANTONG", "axis": "debt", "delta": 2}, {"type": "setFlag", "key": "clue.feather_kept_secret", "value": true}], "next": "V01-C01-N016"}
      ],
      "tags": ["main", "dream", "rumor"]
    },
    {
      "id": "V01-C01-N016",
      "chapter": "ACT3_RIVER_REVERSED",
      "title": "旧盐井",
      "presentation": "dungeon_entry",
      "blocks": [
        {"type": "narration", "text": "所有线索最终都指向旧盐井。井在村北荒坡，封了二十年，井栏刻着‘水下有天，不可仰看’。黑雨沿石缝向下流，井口却不断吹出干燥热风。风里夹着鸟羽焦糊的气味。"},
        {"type": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC-JIANPO", "text": "我年轻时下过一次。井底没有盐，只有一小块白天。我们封井，不是怕里面的东西出来，是怕村里人把白天挖完拿去卖。"},
        {"type": "narration", "text": "缄婆承认杳湾数代人都从井中偷取‘昼盐’，掺进灯油与药膏。三年前产量断绝，村里却继续向北方使者交货。有人开始用牲血和孩子的梦催井。黑雨不是第一场报复，只是第一场所有人都能看见的报复。"}
      ],
      "onEnterEffects": [
        {"type": "unlockCodex", "codexId": "CX-V01-PLACE-DAYSALTWELL", "layer": "rumor"},
        {"type": "startQuest", "questId": "Q-V01-MAIN-004"}
      ],
      "choices": [
        {"id": "V01-C01-N016-A", "label": "准备绳索、陶哨与净水后下井", "enabledWhen": [{"type": "hasAnyItem", "itemIds": ["IT-V01-TOOL-CRACKEDWHISTLE", "IT-V01-MAT-RAINREED"]}], "disabledHint": "缺少能辨认井下风向或储存黑雨的工具。", "effects": [{"type": "setFlag", "key": "well.descent_prepared", "value": true}], "next": "V01-C01-N017"},
        {"id": "V01-C01-N016-B", "label": "立刻沿井绳下去", "effects": [{"type": "addStatus", "statusId": "ST-BlackRainExposure", "duration": "ACT4"}], "next": "V01-C01-N017"},
        {"id": "V01-C01-N016-C", "label": "要求缄婆先公开昼盐旧账", "effects": [{"type": "setWorldVar", "key": "village.day_salt_truth_public", "value": true}, {"type": "changeRelation", "npcId": "NPC-JIANPO", "axis": "trust", "delta": -1}, {"type": "changeRelation", "npcId": "NPC-YANBO", "axis": "respect", "delta": 1}], "next": "V01-C01-N017"}
      ],
      "tags": ["main", "dungeon", "collective_guilt"]
    },
    {
      "id": "V01-C01-N017",
      "chapter": "ACT4_NIGHT_WITHOUT_SUN",
      "title": "井底的一小块白天",
      "presentation": "dungeon",
      "blocks": [
        {"type": "narration", "text": "井深七十丈。前十丈听见雨，二十丈听见河，三十丈以后只听见自己的骨头。井壁嵌满挖昼盐留下的凹痕，每一道都亮着微弱晨光。光照在人脸上，使人看见自己尚未做出的选择：有人看见富贵，有人看见逃亡，你看见一座被十个太阳同时照亮的空村。"},
        {"type": "narration", "text": "井底果然有一小块白天，铺在盐池上，薄得像冰。白昼中央伏着一头由黑雨、鱼骨和人声聚成的兽。它没有眼，背上却长着数十张熟人的嘴。每张嘴都在讲述同一件事的不同版本。它把被雨洗掉的言语吃进腹中，所以村人越遗忘，它越肥大。"},
        {"type": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC-JIANPO", "text": "含晦。我们造的东西，总要等它能吃人了，才肯给它取名。"},
        {"type": "system", "text": "遭遇：含晦。可观察、封井、诱离、交涉、战斗或撤退。击杀并非默认目标。"}
      ],
      "onEnterEffects": [
        {"type": "startEncounter", "encounterId": "EN-V01-ELITE-HANHUI"},
        {"type": "unlockCodex", "codexId": "CX-V01-BEAST-HANHUI", "layer": "first_sight"}
      ],
      "choices": [
        {"id": "V01-C01-N017-A", "label": "用扶桑烬照见它吞下的第一句话", "enabledWhen": [{"type": "itemRecognitionAtLeast", "itemId": "IT-V01-MAT-EMBERLEAF", "stage": "verified"}], "costs": [{"type": "item", "itemId": "IT-V01-MAT-EMBERLEAF", "quantity": 1}, {"type": "memory", "amount": 1}], "effects": [{"type": "setFlag", "key": "hanhui.first_words_revealed", "value": true}], "next": "V01-C01-N018"},
        {"id": "V01-C01-N017-B", "label": "用陶哨引它离开白昼盐池", "enabledWhen": [{"type": "hasItem", "itemId": "IT-V01-TOOL-CRACKEDWHISTLE", "quantity": 1}], "effects": [{"type": "setFlag", "key": "hanhui.displaced", "value": true}], "next": "V01-C01-N019"},
        {"id": "V01-C01-N017-C", "label": "割破雨芦，让黑雨倒灌进它体内", "enabledWhen": [{"type": "hasItem", "itemId": "IT-V01-MAT-RAINREED", "quantity": 1}], "costs": [{"type": "item", "itemId": "IT-V01-MAT-RAINREED", "quantity": 1}], "effects": [{"type": "setFlag", "key": "hanhui.overfed", "value": true}], "next": "V01-C01-N019"},
        {"id": "V01-C01-N017-D", "label": "正面攻击含晦", "effects": [{"type": "beginCombat", "encounterId": "EN-V01-ELITE-HANHUI", "solution": "force"}], "next": "V01-C01-N020"},
        {"id": "V01-C01-N017-E", "label": "撤回井口，准备后再来", "effects": [{"type": "advanceTime", "hours": 6}, {"type": "changeWorldVar", "key": "village.water_sickness", "delta": 1}], "next": "V01-C01-N016"}
      ],
      "tags": ["main", "elite_encounter", "multi_solution"]
    },
    {
      "id": "V01-C01-N018",
      "chapter": "ACT4_NIGHT_WITHOUT_SUN",
      "title": "第一句谎话",
      "presentation": "revelation",
      "blocks": [
        {"type": "narration", "text": "扶桑烬落在白昼上，像一滴火落回太阳。含晦背上的嘴依次闭合，只剩最小的一张。那是缄婆年轻时的声音：‘井里的光取之不尽。’紧接着，第二句来自砚伯的父亲：‘孩子做梦不算受苦。’第三句来自一个北方使者：‘天上的日不会知道。’"},
        {"type": "narration", "text": "最后，一句不属于杳湾的声音从兽腹深处传来：‘让他带箭逃，逃得越远，追来的人越晚看见东方。’声音说完，三影尸体的脸在水面浮现。他睁开眼，对你无声地说：我不是死者，我是路。"},
        {"type": "narration", "text": "你失去了一件记忆。也许是母亲某次呼唤你的声调，也许是幼年院墙的颜色。空缺很小，却有风从里面吹过。你终于明白扶桑烬的代价从不宏大；它只拿走那些没人能替你证明的小事。"}
      ],
      "onExitEffects": [
        {"type": "setFlag", "key": "clue.corpse_is_road", "value": true},
        {"type": "unlockCodex", "codexId": "CX-V01-BEAST-HANHUI", "layer": "evidence"},
        {"type": "resolveEncounter", "encounterId": "EN-V01-ELITE-HANHUI", "result": "released_words"}
      ],
      "choices": [
        {"id": "V01-C01-N018-A", "label": "让含晦吐出所有被洗去的话", "irreversible": true, "effects": [{"type": "setWorldVar", "key": "village.memories_restored", "value": true}, {"type": "setWorldVar", "key": "village.day_salt_truth_public", "value": true}, {"type": "addStatus", "statusId": "ST-MemoryFray", "duration": "VOLUME"}], "next": "V01-C01-N021"},
        {"id": "V01-C01-N018-B", "label": "只取与三影尸体有关的证词", "effects": [{"type": "setFlag", "key": "evidence.corpse_words_preserved", "value": true}], "next": "V01-C01-N021"}
      ],
      "tags": ["main", "truth", "memory_cost"]
    },
    {
      "id": "V01-C01-N019",
      "chapter": "ACT4_NIGHT_WITHOUT_SUN",
      "title": "让怪物换一个饥饿",
      "presentation": "encounter_resolution",
      "blocks": [
        {"type": "narration", "text": "含晦追逐陶哨中的空声，或贪婪吞下雨芦里储存的黑雨。它离开白昼盐池，身体便失去形状，散成数百句没有主人的话。你们用陶罐逐一收拢，罐子里有人认罪、有人求饶、有人只说今晚想吃一碗热粥。"},
        {"type": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC-JIANPO", "text": "世上最难封的不是妖，是一句终于有人肯听的话。"},
        {"type": "narration", "text": "盐池下露出一枚赤金箭镞的铸范。范上没有羿名，只有十只足印，其中一只被人为磨去。箭不是为杀某个人打造的；它的尺寸从一开始就属于天上的东西。"}
      ],
      "onExitEffects": [
        {"type": "addItem", "itemId": "IT-V01-CLUE-ARROWMOLD", "quantity": 1},
        {"type": "setFlag", "key": "clue.arrow_made_for_sun", "value": true},
        {"type": "resolveEncounter", "encounterId": "EN-V01-ELITE-HANHUI", "result": "contained"}
      ],
      "choices": [
        {"id": "V01-C01-N019-A", "label": "封存话罐，保留证词", "effects": [{"type": "setWorldVar", "key": "hanhui.fate", "value": "contained"}, {"type": "addItem", "itemId": "IT-V01-UNIQUE-VOICEJAR", "quantity": 1}], "next": "V01-C01-N021"},
        {"id": "V01-C01-N019-B", "label": "打开话罐，让言语回到村里", "effects": [{"type": "setWorldVar", "key": "village.memories_restored", "value": true}, {"type": "setWorldVar", "key": "hanhui.fate", "value": "dispersed"}], "next": "V01-C01-N021"}
      ],
      "tags": ["main", "nonlethal", "evidence"]
    },
    {
      "id": "V01-C01-N020",
      "chapter": "ACT4_NIGHT_WITHOUT_SUN",
      "title": "杀死由遗忘组成的兽",
      "presentation": "combat_resolution",
      "blocks": [
        {"type": "narration", "text": "武器每击中含晦一次，便有一句话永远消失。它用死者的求救扰乱你，用亲人的声音诱你回头，用你自己的声音承诺只要停手便可得到清白。井底白昼在搏斗中碎裂，光片割伤皮肤，伤口流出的血先红后黑。"},
        {"type": "narration", "text": "最后一击落下时，含晦缩成一枚无字的舌骨。村里所有人同时停顿片刻，却没人知道自己忘了什么。你赢了，胜利干净得令人害怕。盐池下露出赤金箭铸范，十只足印中有一只被磨掉；除此之外，再没有证词能够解释它。"},
        {"type": "system", "text": "含晦已被击杀。获得材料【无辞舌骨】；与其吞噬的部分证词永久失去。"}
      ],
      "onExitEffects": [
        {"type": "addItem", "itemId": "IT-V01-MAT-WORDLESSBONE", "quantity": 1},
        {"type": "addItem", "itemId": "IT-V01-CLUE-ARROWMOLD", "quantity": 1},
        {"type": "setWorldVar", "key": "hanhui.fate", "value": "killed"},
        {"type": "setWorldVar", "key": "village.memories_restored", "value": false},
        {"type": "resolveEncounter", "encounterId": "EN-V01-ELITE-HANHUI", "result": "killed"}
      ],
      "choices": [
        {"id": "V01-C01-N020-A", "label": "带铸范返回井口", "next": "V01-C01-N021"}
      ],
      "tags": ["main", "combat", "costly_victory"]
    },
    {
      "id": "V01-C01-N021",
      "chapter": "ACT4_NIGHT_WITHOUT_SUN",
      "title": "羿从西边来",
      "presentation": "character_entrance",
      "blocks": [
        {"type": "narration", "text": "你们出井时，黑雨已下到第六日。一个高瘦男人站在井栏旁，蓑衣下背着空箭囊，手里那张弓没有弦。他像赶了很远的路，又像只是从隔壁屋檐下避雨回来。村里的狗不叫，三影尸体的三道影子却同时朝他跪下。"},
        {"type": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC-YI", "text": "谁动过箭？"},
        {"type": "narration", "text": "他自称羿。说出名字时没有雷，也没有神光，只是第二个月亮停转了一瞬。你出示拓印、铸范或讲述尸体异状。羿逐一听完，始终望着自己的双手。"},
        {"type": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC-YI", "text": "箭上是我的名，手法也是我的。可我还没有造过这支箭，更没有射它。有人把将来的罪先送来，要我照着犯。"},
        {"type": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC-YI", "text": "尸体不是日。日若死，影子只有一道，因为天下万物都替它作影。这东西是送箭的路，是从东方逃出来的一段白昼。它死在这里，说明扶桑不想让消息走得更远。"}
      ],
      "onEnterEffects": [
        {"type": "unlockCodex", "codexId": "CX-V01-PERSON-YI", "layer": "first_sight"},
        {"type": "completeObjective", "questId": "Q-V01-MAIN-004", "objectiveId": "resolve_hanhui"},
        {"type": "startQuest", "questId": "Q-V01-MAIN-005"}
      ],
      "choices": [
        {"id": "V01-C01-N021-A", "label": "把所有证据交给羿", "effects": [{"type": "changeRelation", "npcId": "NPC-YI", "axis": "trust", "delta": 2}, {"type": "setFlag", "key": "yi.has_full_evidence", "value": true}], "next": "V01-C01-N022"},
        {"id": "V01-C01-N021-B", "label": "隐去昼盐旧账，只谈扶桑", "effects": [{"type": "changeRelation", "npcId": "NPC-YI", "axis": "trust", "delta": -1}, {"type": "setFlag", "key": "yi.village_crime_hidden", "value": true}], "next": "V01-C01-N022"},
        {"id": "V01-C01-N021-C", "label": "质问羿为何带着空箭囊", "effects": [{"type": "changeRelation", "npcId": "NPC-YI", "axis": "respect", "delta": 1}, {"type": "setFlag", "key": "clue.yi_dreamed_shots", "value": true}], "next": "V01-C01-N022"}
      ],
      "tags": ["main", "yi", "revelation"]
    },
    {
      "id": "V01-C01-N022",
      "chapter": "ACT5_TEN_SUN_OMEN",
      "title": "第七日以前",
      "presentation": "council",
      "blocks": [
        {"type": "narration", "text": "羿说第七日雨停时，三影尸体会完成它最后的使命：箭将从尸体中脱出，替尚未发生的射击选择第一个目标。若封住箭，扶桑便不知道人间已经收到警告；若拔出箭，持箭者会被天上的目光看见；若毁尸，箭会在无人知道的地方重新长成。"},
        {"type": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC-YANBO", "text": "听起来每条路都坏。"},
        {"type": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC-YI", "text": "路本来不分好坏，只分代价由谁来付。神把两者混在一起讲，是为了让人付钱时还道谢。"},
        {"type": "narration", "text": "村民要求羿带走尸体，北方使者季狸却在此时抵达，宣称昼盐与天尸都归联盟祭库。九黎流民黎苇认出骨牌上的盐泽路标，警告使者会把杳湾灭口。雨中第一次出现了人的刀光，竟比神异更令众人熟悉。"}
      ],
      "choices": [
        {"id": "V01-C01-N022-A", "label": "支持羿，在北滩守到雨停", "effects": [{"type": "setWorldVar", "key": "finale.plan", "value": "guard"}, {"type": "changeRelation", "npcId": "NPC-YI", "axis": "trust", "delta": 1}], "next": "V01-C01-N023"},
        {"id": "V01-C01-N022-B", "label": "公开全部旧账，迫使村民共同决定", "visibleWhen": [{"type": "worldVarEquals", "key": "village.day_salt_truth_public", "value": true}], "effects": [{"type": "setWorldVar", "key": "finale.plan", "value": "assembly"}, {"type": "setWorldVar", "key": "village.self_rule", "value": 1}], "next": "V01-C01-N023"},
        {"id": "V01-C01-N022-C", "label": "与季狸交易，用尸体换取全村撤离", "effects": [{"type": "setWorldVar", "key": "finale.plan", "value": "trade"}, {"type": "setFlag", "key": "corpse.claimed_by_north", "value": true}], "next": "V01-C01-N023"},
        {"id": "V01-C01-N022-D", "label": "听从黎苇，连夜把尸体送进盐泽", "effects": [{"type": "setWorldVar", "key": "finale.plan", "value": "smuggle"}, {"type": "changeRelation", "npcId": "NPC-LIWEI", "axis": "trust", "delta": 2}], "next": "V01-C01-N023"}
      ],
      "tags": ["main", "final_plan", "faction"]
    },
    {
      "id": "V01-C01-N023",
      "chapter": "ACT5_TEN_SUN_OMEN",
      "title": "黑雨停了",
      "presentation": "climax",
      "blocks": [
        {"type": "narration", "text": "第七日正午，黑雨停了。最后一滴悬在三影尸体眉心，迟迟不落。杳湾忽然明亮得像从未经历过夜，所有湿透的屋瓦一齐冒出白烟。赤水开始倒流，河中鱼群腹部朝天，却仍活着游向东方。"},
        {"type": "narration", "text": "尸体站起。三道影子先后回到他脚下：少年使他有了面容，鸟使他有了呼吸，无头者使他举起双手。他抓住胸口赤金箭，看向你。那双眼里没有瞳孔，各盛着一轮遥远的日。"},
        {"type": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC-THREESHADOW", "text": "我替明日死在昨日。箭替后羿来，也替后羿回去。不要问我是谁；名字已被他们从第十棵桑上刮掉。问你愿意让谁先知道。"},
        {"type": "narration", "text": "季狸的人举起弩，黎苇点燃盐草，村民围在白灰线外，羿把无弦之弓横在膝前。所有人都等你先动，仿佛普通人的第一个动作，能替神决定后来的传说。"}
      ],
      "choices": [
        {"id": "V01-C01-N023-A", "label": "拔出赤金箭，交给羿", "irreversible": true, "effects": [{"type": "setWorldVar", "key": "unique.red_arrow.owner", "value": "NPC-YI"}, {"type": "setWorldVar", "key": "corpse.fate", "value": "released"}, {"type": "setFlag", "key": "ending.path_yi", "value": true}], "next": "V01-C01-N024"},
        {"id": "V01-C01-N023-B", "label": "让尸体带箭继续向东", "irreversible": true, "enabledWhen": [{"type": "anyFlagTrue", "keys": ["clue.corpse_is_road", "clue.bone_token_fusang"]}], "disabledHint": "你还不知道尸体究竟是一具人，还是一条路。", "effects": [{"type": "setWorldVar", "key": "unique.red_arrow.owner", "value": "NPC-THREESHADOW"}, {"type": "setWorldVar", "key": "corpse.fate", "value": "eastbound"}, {"type": "setFlag", "key": "ending.path_east", "value": true}], "next": "V01-C01-N025"},
        {"id": "V01-C01-N023-C", "label": "折断箭杆，把箭镞留给人间", "irreversible": true, "enabledWhen": [{"type": "hasItem", "itemId": "IT-V01-CLUE-ARROWMOLD", "quantity": 1}], "disabledHint": "你不知道赤金箭的受力与铸造弱点。", "effects": [{"type": "setWorldVar", "key": "unique.red_arrow.owner", "value": "PLAYER"}, {"type": "setWorldVar", "key": "corpse.fate", "value": "unmade"}, {"type": "addItem", "itemId": "IT-V01-UNIQUE-REDARROWHEAD", "quantity": 1}, {"type": "setFlag", "key": "ending.path_mortal", "value": true}], "next": "V01-C01-N026"},
        {"id": "V01-C01-N023-D", "label": "允许季狸接管尸体，兑现撤村交易", "irreversible": true, "visibleWhen": [{"type": "worldVarEquals", "key": "finale.plan", "value": "trade"}], "effects": [{"type": "setWorldVar", "key": "unique.red_arrow.owner", "value": "FACTION-NORTH"}, {"type": "setWorldVar", "key": "corpse.fate", "value": "seized"}, {"type": "setFlag", "key": "ending.path_north", "value": true}], "next": "V01-C01-N027"}
      ],
      "tags": ["main", "climax", "irreversible"]
    },
    {
      "id": "V01-C01-N024",
      "chapter": "ACT5_TEN_SUN_OMEN",
      "title": "把未来交给射手",
      "presentation": "ending",
      "blocks": [
        {"type": "narration", "text": "你握住箭杆。它比人体温更暖，仿佛已经穿过许多个尚未发生的正午。拔箭时尸体没有流血，三道影子却各自惨叫一声：少年叫的是母亲，鸟叫的是东方，无头者叫的是你的名字。"},
        {"type": "narration", "text": "羿接箭后沉默很久。他把箭放进空箭囊，囊中立刻传出九支箭互相碰撞的声音。三影者向你行了一个无人见过的礼，身体散成白昼碎片，落进赤水。河水恢复东流，带走所有碎片，唯独一片停在阿禾掌心。"},
        {"type": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC-YI", "text": "我不会许诺射或不射。许诺是事情尚且容易时说的话。等天上真的有十个太阳，你若还活着，就来问我第二次。"},
        {"type": "narration", "text": "羿向东去了。后来村人争论是你把武器交给英雄，还是把罪交给一个尚未犯罪的人。两种说法都传得很远，而且都比事实动听。"}
      ],
      "onExitEffects": [{"type": "setWorldVar", "key": "faction.yi_mission", "value": "armed_by_future"}, {"type": "unlockCodex", "codexId": "CX-V01-ITEM-REDARROW", "layer": "echo"}],
      "choices": [{"id": "V01-C01-N024-A", "label": "观看杳湾余响", "next": "V01-C01-N028"}],
      "tags": ["main", "ending_yi"]
    },
    {
      "id": "V01-C01-N025",
      "chapter": "ACT5_TEN_SUN_OMEN",
      "title": "让路继续走",
      "presentation": "ending",
      "blocks": [
        {"type": "narration", "text": "你没有拔箭，而是替三影者解开缠在脚踝上的水草。他向东迈步，第一步踏过北滩，第二步踏到赤水中央，第三步已在所有人的视线之外。河面上留下三条明亮的路，一条通往扶桑，一条通往还没到来的十日，一条回到你脚下。"},
        {"type": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC-YI", "text": "你放走了证据，也放走了警告。也许是慈悲，也许只是把选择推迟。天地最喜欢人把推迟叫慈悲。"},
        {"type": "narration", "text": "翌日，东桑林少了一棵没有名字的树。阿禾坚称那棵树昨夜变成人走了。砚伯把这句话记进历书，又在旁边写：小儿之言，不足为信。多年以后，他的后人只抄了前半句。"}
      ],
      "onExitEffects": [{"type": "setWorldVar", "key": "faction.fusang.warning_received", "value": "uncertain"}, {"type": "unlockCodex", "codexId": "CX-V01-PERSON-THREESHADOW", "layer": "echo"}],
      "choices": [{"id": "V01-C01-N025-A", "label": "观看杳湾余响", "next": "V01-C01-N028"}],
      "tags": ["main", "ending_east"]
    },
    {
      "id": "V01-C01-N026",
      "chapter": "ACT5_TEN_SUN_OMEN",
      "title": "人间留下一点锋利",
      "presentation": "ending",
      "blocks": [
        {"type": "narration", "text": "你把铸范垫在箭下，从第三圈金纹处折断箭杆。巨响并不来自手中，而来自天顶，仿佛有一扇门被人在另一侧踢了一脚。箭镞冷却成普通金属，箭杆则化为十只火鸟，九只向东，一只钻进你的影子。"},
        {"type": "narration", "text": "三影者第一次露出近似笑意的表情。他把失去箭镞的伤口合拢，身体缩成一个与阿禾年纪相仿的少年，却仍记不起名字。杳湾收留了他，给他取名‘迟日’，因为他总在日落后才觉得温暖。"},
        {"type": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC-YI", "text": "你让一支命定的箭变成了两件不确定的东西。神不会喜欢。人间也未必配得上。收好它，等你明白武器也会选择主人。"},
        {"type": "narration", "text": "从此你影中藏着一只不会鸣叫的火鸟。它每逢有人谈起命数便睁开眼，使你知道所谓命定，多半只是某个强者比别人更早写下的计划。"}
      ],
      "onExitEffects": [{"type": "setWorldVar", "key": "npc.chiri.alive", "value": true}, {"type": "addTrait", "traitId": "TR-FirebirdShadow"}, {"type": "unlockCodex", "codexId": "CX-V01-ITEM-REDARROW", "layer": "evidence"}],
      "choices": [{"id": "V01-C01-N026-A", "label": "观看杳湾余响", "next": "V01-C01-N028"}],
      "tags": ["main", "ending_mortal", "hidden_route"]
    },
    {
      "id": "V01-C01-N027",
      "chapter": "ACT5_TEN_SUN_OMEN",
      "title": "一村人的价钱",
      "presentation": "ending",
      "blocks": [
        {"type": "narration", "text": "季狸用青铜匣收殓尸体，匣盖合拢时，三道影子仍留在滩上。他兑现诺言，给每户一枚迁徙木牌、三日口粮和北地居住的凭证。村人排队领取，队伍安静得像在参加一场没有死者的葬礼。"},
        {"type": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC-JILI", "text": "活下来不是耻辱。把活命的代价说成耻辱，是没付钱的人才有的体面。"},
        {"type": "narration", "text": "七日后，护送青铜匣的队伍在盐泽失踪。北方公文说从未派过季狸，季狸的同伴却带着盖有真印的文书。杳湾人散居各地，把黑雨故事讲成十几个版本；共同之处只有一件：他们都说是自己最后离开村子。"}
      ],
      "onExitEffects": [{"type": "setWorldVar", "key": "village.evacuated", "value": true}, {"type": "setWorldVar", "key": "faction.north.has_red_arrow", "value": "missing_in_transit"}, {"type": "unlockCodex", "codexId": "CX-V01-EVENT-BLACKRAIN", "layer": "echo"}],
      "choices": [{"id": "V01-C01-N027-A", "label": "观看杳湾余响", "next": "V01-C01-N028"}],
      "tags": ["main", "ending_north"]
    },
    {
      "id": "V01-C01-N028",
      "chapter": "ACT5_TEN_SUN_OMEN",
      "title": "杳湾余响",
      "presentation": "echo_summary",
      "blocks": [
        {"type": "conditional", "when": [{"type": "worldVarEquals", "key": "village.granary.saved", "value": true}], "text": "你最初救下的粮食撑过了断路的十二日。青芽把发根的黑粟单独埋下，翌年长出一小片只在夜里成熟的谷。"},
        {"type": "conditional", "when": [{"type": "worldVarEquals", "key": "npc.goat_xiaoman.alive", "value": true}], "text": "小满活了下来。它此后拒绝踩自己的影子，总在灾祸到来前一天朝东方鸣叫。阿禾靠它救过许多人，也因此再没能把它当作一只普通羊。"},
        {"type": "conditional", "when": [{"type": "worldVarEquals", "key": "village.memories_restored", "value": true}], "text": "被含晦吞下的话回到各自主人的梦中。有人道歉，有人逃亡，两户为旧债结仇，也有人终于知道失踪的亲人最后说了什么。真相没有使村子和睦，只使每个人重新拥有了选择恨谁的权利。"},
        {"type": "conditional", "when": [{"type": "worldVarEquals", "key": "hanhui.fate", "value": "killed"}], "text": "含晦死后，村人变得异常善忘。他们过得更轻松，却再也无法完整复述昼盐旧账。缄婆把无辞舌骨称作你们赢来的败仗。"},
        {"type": "conditional", "when": [{"type": "worldVarEquals", "key": "village.day_salt_truth_public", "value": true}], "text": "昼盐旧账被刻在井栏上，没有删去任何一户的名字。多年以后，后人把石栏供为‘诚实之碑’，却很少提起那份诚实是在井枯之后才出现的。"},
        {"type": "narration", "text": "黑雨停后的第十天，寻常的太阳终于升起。村人走出屋门，先欢呼，随后一个接一个沉默。蓝天深处还有九枚极淡的圆影，像被布遮住的灯。它们从东方排到西方，每一枚都在缓慢变亮。"},
        {"type": "narration", "text": "羿站在很远的山脊上数它们。数到第九，他停了一次；再数时，天空已有十个太阳。最小的那一个尚未发光，只投下一道横跨山河的影子。影子的尽头，恰好落在你身上。"},
        {"type": "system", "text": "第一卷《黑雨》完。已解锁第二卷预告《十日：太阳从来不是一颗》。"}
      ],
      "onExitEffects": [
        {"type": "setWorldVar", "key": "sky.suns.count", "value": 10},
        {"type": "completeQuest", "questId": "Q-V01-MAIN-005"},
        {"type": "completeVolume", "volume": "V01"},
        {"type": "unlockContent", "contentId": "V02-PREVIEW"}
      ],
      "choices": [],
      "tags": ["main", "volume_end", "world_echo"]
    }
  ]
}
